10:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"For informational app pages that do not provide a file — pages that only point to the Play Store or an official site — verification means checking the facts from official sources and showing them as they are, including unwelcome facts such as an app being paid, or an app being information-only because no safe official download route exists. No security score is shown for apps whose files we did not check ourselves, because a score without a check is an empty claim."}]
11:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Corrections and Feedback"}]
12:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":["We can be wrong, and we want to know when that happens. If you find an incorrect fact, an official link that has changed, or an app we should not recommend, submit a correction through the ",["$","$L5",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-linkblue","href":"/en/contact","children":"Contact"}]," page. Accepted corrections will be recorded on the affected page, and pages proven to no longer meet our standards will be corrected or withdrawn. Reports about suspicious files are handled through the same route."]}]
13:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"What We Never Do"}]
14:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"This site never provides pirated apps, modified apps, gambling apps, or adult apps — in any form, including as links. We do not promote apps that break Indonesian law, we do not disguise paid apps as free, and we do not use misleading download buttons. When a popular app turns out to be available only through unofficial or unlawful routes, our page will explain it as information only and point you to a legal alternative, rather than providing the file."}]
15:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"The same principle applies to our free tools: nothing asks for your password, none of your files are stored, and no results are invented. That is the standard we hold for every page, tool, and file on this site."}]
